    "title": "Analytics integrity and feature-health observability take shape",
    "intro": "Today's nightly is heavy on reliability plumbing: the team rebuilt analytics into a contract-enforced pipeline across web, desktop, and mobile, and reshaped feature-health probes so each check declares which runtime it actually exercised. Two follow-up fixes tightened release guards against dirty builds and aligned live probe fixtures with the new expectations.",
    "entries": [
