        "title": "Live probe fixtures aligned with new process-run and share expectations",
        "summary": "A follow-up tightens the process-run lifecycle probe to construct a real runnable graph and waits for share messages to materialize before asserting.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "The process-run-lifecycle probe now builds a proper agent + ignition + action + connection graph and reports agentId, ignitionNodeId, actionNodeId, and connectionId as required evidence, matching the new check expectations.",
